> OSFRTDEV410?? on 4.0d?
> .
> .
> Anyone shed any light on this for me?
> 
> TIA

The OSFRTDEV subset was combined into the OSFBASE and OSFLIBA subsets.

With V4.0D you always have the RealTime shared library on every system
and if you want to link static binaries you need to load the OSFLIBA
that contains all the static libraries that have associated shared
libraries.

