There should be a group of special files:
/dev/rz4a
/dev/rz4b
/dev/rz4c
.........
/dev/rz4h

If not then:

# cd /dev
# ./MAKEDEV rz4

The comand to mount cd-rom is: mount -r /dev/rz4c /mnt

You can create a mount point specifically for cd-rom, like:

# mkdir /cdrom

Nix.





