GNU Emacs is ditributed with Digital UNIX. Now, depending on which
version of Digital UNIX you are running, you may get different version 
of Emacs (I don't know exactly which one were shipped). Anyway,
Digital UNIX V4.0D ships with Gnu Emacs 19.28. If you want to install
it, get/install the OSFEMACSxxx subset from your base operating system 
CD.

If you want to use more recent version of Emacs, you can use either
Gnu Emacs 20.2 or XEmacs 20.4. Both are available in source form and
