Subject: Re: how important are {rpm,trackskew,cylinderskew}?
Date: 1998/05/04
Message-ID: <6il2k5$66i$1@nntpd.lkg.dec.com>#1/1
X-Deja-AN: 350181936
References: <Es6FHv.203@campus-news-reading.utoronto.ca>
