> 
> 1) Why isn't my system getting tuned for the values I'm setting?
> 2) How do I tune my system for more than 4107 threads?

The hardware has support for 8192 LDT entries on one
page. Unless the OS supports soft switching (there was
a softswitching patch for Linux) you can't have more
threads.

Each thread uses two entries and the other ones are used
by the system...

